WEBVTT

00:30:29.004 --> 00:30:30.885
Memberships weren't growing like crazy,

00:30:30.909 --> 00:30:33.018
but there was steady growth.

00:30:33.042 --> 00:30:34.492
Lynda paid attention to that.

00:30:35.541 --> 00:30:38.153
Eventually they hit an inflection point.

00:30:38.177 --> 00:30:42.010
While Lynda.com was quietly adding
hours of material to their catalog,

00:30:42.034 --> 00:30:44.974
more people were using
the internet for online learning.

00:30:45.290 --> 00:30:47.421
Their online audience doubled each year.

00:30:47.445 --> 00:30:49.668
And in time that grew into a big number.

00:30:49.983 --> 00:30:53.348
By 2012, they had
over a million paying users

00:30:53.372 --> 00:30:55.769
and over a hundred million
dollars in revenue.

00:30:55.793 --> 00:30:59.726
LW: It was literally
a very organic growth process.